[I] Library for generating TOTP and HOTP

[T] libcotp is a C library for generating TOTP (RFC 6238) and HOTP (RFC
[T] 4226) one-time passwords with SHA-1, SHA-256 and SHA-512. It also
[T] supports Steam Guard and Yandex codes, Base32 encoding and otpauth URI
[T] parsing.

[U] https://github.com/paolostivanin/libcotp

[A] Libcotp Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/base
[F] CROSS

[V] 4.2.2
